==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Any [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]] like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] will get the job done relatively easily.

